# CleanTranslate behind Caddy (automatic HTTPS). Pick one of the blocks.

# 1) Own subdomain
translate.example.com {
	encode zstd gzip
	reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8080
}

# 2) A path on an existing site (start the app with BASE_PATH=/translate)
example.com {
	redir /translate /translate/
	handle /translate/* {
		reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8080
	}
	# … the rest of your site …
}

# 3) Password-protect at the proxy instead of in the app (hash: caddy hash-password)
